<title>DENMARK: Tele Danmark rises on Swiss telecom deal.</title>
<headline>Tele Danmark rises on Swiss telecom deal.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Danish telecommunications group Tele Danmark rose on Monday in the wake of Friday's announcement that it was buying along with British Telecommunications Plc a 49 percent stake in a new Swiss telecoms group.</p>
<p>Tele Danmark shares were up nine crowns from the opening at 304 crowns at 1325 gmt in 124,488 share turnover.</p>
<p>On Friday, Switzerland's Newtelco, a group including the Swiss Federal Railways and retailer Migros, said it picked BT and TeleDanmark as its international partners. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
